X:1
T:Lamp of Our Feet
T:ST AGNES
C:Music: John B. Dykes, 1866 · Words: Bernard Barton, 1826
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: Hymnal and Canticles of the Protestant Episcopal Church, 1875, Hymn 69, first tune Lyrics from : Eclectic Review, 1836, p.478-479. All but last two verses found. No second score was available to cross-check the melody.
