w: Lamp of our feet! where- by we trace Our path, when wont to stray;
w: Bread of our souls! where- on we feed; True man- na from on high!
w: Pil- lar of fire\- through watch- es dark! Or ra- diant cloud by day!
w: Pole\- star on life's tem- pest- uous deep! Bea- con! when doubts sur- round;
w: Rich- es in pov- er- ty! our aid In ev- ery need- ful hour!
w: Pure o- rac- les of truth di- vine! Un- like each fabled dream Giv-
w: Word of the ev- er- liv- ing God! Will of His glo- rious Son!
w: And we, if we a- right would learn The wis- dom it im- parts,
